# CIDR / VLSM Network Design Lab

This lab demonstrates how to design a subnetting plan using CIDR and Variable Length Subnet Masking (VLSM). The network was built in Cisco Packet Tracer using multiple routers, LAN segments, and point-to-point WAN links.

## Skills Practiced
- CIDR addressing
- VLSM subnetting
- Router interface configuration
- Static routing or dynamic routing
- Packet Tracer topology design
- Connectivity testing with ping
